sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant UI as User Interface
    participant API as FastAPI Router
    participant Service as MazeService
    participant Utils as Utils
    participant QC as QueryConstructor
    participant DA as DataAccess
    participant DB as Database

    Note over User,DB: 🔍 GET - Detailed Flow

    User->>UI: Clicks component
    activate UI
    UI->>API: GET /component?componentID=x
    activate API
    API->>Service: get_data('Component', None, format_object={componentID:x})
    activate Service

    Note over Service,DB: Step 1 - Fetch Query Config from x000005
    Service->>DA: fetch_query_config('Component')
    activate DA
    DA->>DB: SELECT from x000005 WHERE type='Component'
    activate DB
    DB-->>DA: query, formatter, param_to_field_mapping, order_by
    deactivate DB
    DA-->>Service: QueryModel or raise SqlAlchemyException (retries 3x)
    deactivate DA
    alt SqlAlchemyException
        Service-->>API: 500 Internal Server Error
        API-->>UI: Error
        UI-->>User: Error message
    else Success
        Note over Service,QC: Step 2 - Build Final SQL
        Service->>QC: create_where_clause(query, column, value)
        activate QC
        QC-->>Service: SQL + WHERE or unchanged
        deactivate QC
        Service->>QC: create_order_by_clause(query, order_by)
        activate QC
        QC-->>Service: SQL + ORDER BY or unchanged
        deactivate QC
        Service->>QC: create_formatted_sql(query_object, format_object)
        activate QC
        QC->>QC: map params + evaluate formatter + substitute values
        QC-->>Service: final executable SQL
        deactivate QC

        Note over Service,DB: Step 3 - Execute Query
        Service->>DA: fetch_all(final_sql)
        activate DA
        DA->>DB: SELECT from Component table
        activate DB
        DB-->>DA: rows or SQLAlchemyError
        deactivate DB
        DA-->>Service: rows or raise SqlAlchemyException (retries 3x)
        deactivate DA
        alt SqlAlchemyException
            Service-->>API: 500 Internal Server Error
            API-->>UI: Error
            UI-->>User: Error message
        else result is empty
            Service-->>API: []
            API-->>UI: 200 OK + []
            UI-->>User: No data found
        else Success
            Service-->>API: output list of dicts
            API-->>UI: 200 OK + result
            UI-->>User: Display component data
        end
    end
    deactivate Service
    deactivate API
    deactivate UI

    Note over User,DB: ➕ POST - Detailed Flow

    User->>UI: Submit form
    activate UI
    UI->>API: POST /component {input: [{column_config_id, value}]}
    activate API
    API->>Service: insert_data(json_object)
    activate Service

    Note over Service,Utils: Step 1 - Validate Payload
    Service->>Utils: extract_generic_tables_data(data, session)
    activate Utils
    Utils->>Utils: get_config_data_object(input)
    alt column_config_id not integer
        Utils-->>Service: raise ValueError Invalid Payload
        Service-->>API: raise Exception
        API-->>UI: HTTPException + detail
        UI-->>User: Invalid Payload error
    else valid
        Note over Utils,DB: Step 2 - Fetch Field Config from x000003
        Utils->>DA: fetch_all(get_save_edit_data WHERE column_config_id IN (...))
        activate DA
        DA->>DB: SELECT from x000003 WHERE column_config_id IN (...)
        activate DB
        DB-->>DA: field definitions (table_name, parent_table_name, pkey, fkey, column mappings)
        deactivate DB
        DA-->>Utils: response_list
        deactivate DA

        Note over Utils: Step 3 - Build Insert List
        Utils->>Utils: group columns by table_name
        Utils->>Utils: cast values per column type
        Utils->>Utils: handle geom column as raw WKT
        Utils->>Utils: sort parent table first (parent_table_name is None)
        Utils-->>Service: insert_list [{table, column_name_value, pkey, fkey}]
        deactivate Utils
    end

    Note over Service,DB: Step 4 - Insert Parent Table
    Service->>QC: create_insert_sql(parent_table_data) + RETURNING pkey
    activate QC
    QC-->>Service: parent INSERT SQL
    deactivate QC
    Service->>DA: insert_update_record(session, sql, return_id=True)
    activate DA
    DA->>DB: INSERT into Parent Table RETURNING primary_key
    activate DB
    DB-->>DA: parent_insert_id or SQLAlchemyError
    deactivate DB
    DA-->>Service: parent_insert_id or raise Exception
    deactivate DA
    alt Error
        Service->>DA: session.rollback()
        Service-->>API: raise Exception
        API-->>UI: HTTPException + mazeresponse detail
        UI-->>User: Error message
    else Success
        Note over Service,DB: Step 5 - Insert Child Table
        Service->>QC: create_insert_sql(child_data + fkey=parent_insert_id)
        activate QC
        QC-->>Service: child INSERT SQL
        deactivate QC
        Service->>DA: insert_update_record(session, sql, return_id)
        activate DA
        DA->>DB: INSERT into Child Table (fkey = parent_insert_id)
        activate DB
        DB-->>DA: child_insert_id or SQLAlchemyError
        deactivate DB
        DA-->>Service: child_insert_id or raise Exception
        deactivate DA
        alt Error
            Service->>DA: session.rollback()
            Service-->>API: raise Exception
            API-->>UI: HTTPException + mazeresponse detail
            UI-->>User: Error message
        else Success
            Note over Service,DB: Step 6 - Optional Form/Task Handling
            alt formid present in request
                Service->>QC: construct_form_dict(taskid)
                activate QC
                QC-->>Service: form_dict
                deactivate QC
                Service->>DA: insert_update_record(session, form_sql, True)
                activate DA
                DA->>DB: INSERT into Form Table RETURNING form_id
                activate DB
                DB-->>DA: form_id
                deactivate DB
                DA-->>Service: form_id
                deactivate DA
                Service->>QC: construct_form_transaction_dict(assetid, workid, taskid, insert_id, form_id)
                activate QC
                QC-->>Service: form_transaction_dict
                deactivate QC
                Service->>DA: insert_update_record(session, form_transaction_sql, True)
                activate DA
                DA->>DB: INSERT into Form Transaction Table
                activate DB
                DB-->>DA: transaction_id
                deactivate DB
                DA-->>Service: transaction_id
                deactivate DA
            else formid not present
                Note over Service: Skip form/task handling
            end
            Note over Service,DB: Step 7 - Commit
            Service->>DA: session.commit()
            activate DA
            DA-->>Service: committed
            deactivate DA
            Service-->>API: {id, status_code, "Data Inserted Successfully"}
            API-->>UI: 201 Created + response
            UI-->>User: Success message
        end
    end
    deactivate Service
    deactivate API
    deactivate UI

    Note over User,DB: ✏️ PUT - Detailed Flow

    User->>UI: Edit and submit form
    activate UI
    UI->>API: PUT /component {input: [{column_config_id, value}], id, operation}
    activate API
    API->>Service: update_data(json_object)
    activate Service

    Note over Service,Utils: Step 1 - Validate Payload
    Service->>Utils: extract_generic_tables_data(data, session)
    activate Utils
    Utils->>Utils: get_config_data_object(input)
    alt column_config_id not integer
        Utils-->>Service: raise ValueError Invalid Payload
        Service-->>API: raise Exception
        API-->>UI: HTTPException + detail
        UI-->>User: Invalid Payload error
    else valid
        Note over Utils,DB: Step 2 - Fetch Field Config from x000003
        Utils->>DA: fetch_all(get_save_edit_data WHERE column_config_id IN (...))
        activate DA
        DA->>DB: SELECT from x000003 WHERE column_config_id IN (...)
        activate DB
        DB-->>DA: field definitions (table_name, parent_table_name, pkey, fkey, column mappings)
        deactivate DB
        DA-->>Utils: response_list
        deactivate DA
        Note over Utils: Step 3 - Build Insert List
        Utils->>Utils: group columns by table_name
        Utils->>Utils: cast values + handle geom
        Utils->>Utils: sort parent table first
        Utils-->>Service: insert_list [{table, column_name_value, pkey, fkey}]
        deactivate Utils
    end

    Note over Service,DB: Step 4 - Operation Based Routing
    Service->>QC: build operation SQL (based on operation type)
    activate QC
    QC-->>Service: SQL
    deactivate QC
    Service->>DA: insert_update_record(session, sql, return_id)
    activate DA
    DA->>DB: Execute operation query
    activate DB
    DB-->>DA: result or SQLAlchemyError
    deactivate DB
    DA-->>Service: result or raise SqlAlchemyException
    deactivate DA

    alt operation = Update_Insert
        Service-->>Service: UPDATE Parent + INSERT Child done
    else operation = Insert_Update
        alt parent_table_name is None
            Service->>DA: session.rollback()
            Service-->>API: {response: "Parent table name is blank"}
            API-->>UI: 202 Accepted + error response
            UI-->>User: Configuration error message
        else parent found
            Service->>DA: insert_update_record(session, parent_child_sql, False)
            activate DA
            DA->>DB: UPDATE Parent-Child relationship
            activate DB
            DB-->>DA: done
            deactivate DB
            DA-->>Service: done
            deactivate DA
        end
    else operation = Update_Update
        Service-->>Service: UPDATE Parent + UPDATE Child done
    else operation = Update_Update_Extended
        Service->>DA: insert_update_record(session, state_sql, False)
        activate DA
        DA->>DB: UPDATE State separately
        activate DB
        DB-->>DA: done
        deactivate DB
        DA-->>Service: done
        deactivate DA
    else operation = Child_Update_Parent
        Service-->>Service: Child drives Parent UPDATE done
    else operation = Reset_Update
        Service->>DA: insert_update_record(session, reset_sql, False)
        activate DA
        DA->>DB: RESET fields to NULL
        activate DB
        DB-->>DA: done
        deactivate DB
        DA-->>Service: done
        deactivate DA
        Service->>DA: insert_update_record(session, update_sql, False)
        activate DA
        DA->>DB: UPDATE with new values
        activate DB
        DB-->>DA: done
        deactivate DB
        DA-->>Service: done
        deactivate DA
    else operation = Insert
        Service-->>Service: INSERT RETURNING insert_id done
    else default - plain UPDATE
        Service->>DA: fetch_all(SELECT EXISTS WHERE pkey=id)
        activate DA
        DA->>DB: CHECK record exists in table
        activate DB
        DB-->>DA: true or false
        deactivate DB
        DA-->>Service: exists result
        deactivate DA
        alt record does not exist
            Service-->>API: raise ValueError(id does not exist)
            API-->>UI: 404 Not Found
            UI-->>User: Not found error
        else record exists
            Service->>DA: insert_update_record(session, update_sql, False)
            activate DA
            DA->>DB: UPDATE Component table
            activate DB
            DB-->>DA: done
            deactivate DB
            DA-->>Service: done
            deactivate DA
        end
    end

    Note over Service,DB: Step 5 - Commit or Rollback
    alt SqlAlchemyException
        Service->>DA: session.rollback()
        Service-->>API: raise SqlAlchemyException
        API-->>UI: HTTPException + mazeresponse detail
        UI-->>User: Error message
    else Success
        Service->>DA: session.commit()
        activate DA
        DA-->>Service: committed
        deactivate DA
        Service-->>API: {response: "Data Inserted/Updated Successfully"}
        API-->>UI: 202 Accepted + response
        UI-->>User: Confirmation message
    end
    deactivate Service
    deactivate API
    deactivate UI